# ChIP-seq / CUT&Tag / ATAC-seq Snakemake Pipeline
# =================================================
# Entry point for the modular Snakemake pipeline suite.
# Sample sheet parsing and config loading happen here.
# Derived metadata, dispatch wrappers, and target builders live in
# workflow/rules/metadata.smk and workflow/rules/targets.smk.
# Executable rules live in workflow/rules/*.smk.

